<div><h3>Klaviyo or Shopify Email for email and sms?</h3><p>Email And Sms beginners do well on native email; Klaviyo fits when email and sms logic leans on events, catalog data, and segment reporting, with profile billing modeled on email and sms expansion.</p></div>
